# wc2 (2026-10-30 night): world at HOME with deferred stores on in every step (the proposal's first half), unprofiled,
# causal delays on top: is the committer still the critical path once its GPU waits are gone (wd1: committer fence
# waits 105 -> 5 ms per frame with deferstores, but the frame only -37 ms)?
ds-0 100 deferstores on
dscd-1 100 deferstores on;;commitdelay 20
dsq0-1 100 deferstores on;;q0delay 20
ds-1 100 deferstores on
dscd-2 100 deferstores on;;commitdelay 20
dsq0-2 100 deferstores on;;q0delay 20
ds-2 100 deferstores on
